pySMESH: the two-step viscous-layer builder puts the layer cells of a face into its group
(SMESH V9_16_0; applies after StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL_cancel.patch).

Defect: StdMeshers_ViscousLayerBuilder::AddLayers on a face (the 2-D path of
StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL::ViscousBuilder::MakeViscousLayers) names a group and leaves it empty.

Symptom: a 1 x 1 square, 2 layers 0.2 thick on its four edges, 3 segments per edge: the
mesh gains its 24 layer quadrangles, and the group of the hypothesis's name holds 0 elements.

Root cause: the group collects the cells the builder marked (StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx:
1298-1309). makeFaces does not mark the quadrangles it makes for a face (:576-590), and the
group is created as a volume group in every case (:1301), which would refuse a face.

Change, in StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx only: makeFaces marks a quadrangle it makes on the
2-D path, and the group is a face group on that path.

Not changed: the 3-D path, where the prisms are marked and the group is a volume group, and
the faces the 3-D path makes on the layer boundary, which stay out of the group.
diff --git a/src/StdMeshers/StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx b/src/StdMeshers/StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx
--- a/src/StdMeshers/StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx
+++ b/src/StdMeshers/StdMeshers_Cartesian_VL.cxx
@@ -584,6 +584,7 @@
           }
           else if ( isMainShape2D )
           {
+            face->setIsMarked( true ); // pySMESH: a layer cell of a 2-D mesh, for the group
             gp_XYZ elementNormal;
             SMESH_MeshAlgos::FaceNormal( face, elementNormal, /*normalized=*/true );
             if ( elementNormal * refNormalVector < 0.0 /* diff orientation from the ref element */)
@@ -1309,7 +1310,9 @@
   // create a group
   if ( !_hyp->GetGroupName().empty() )
   {
-    SMDS_MeshGroup* group = _hyp->CreateGroup( _hyp->GetGroupName(), theMesh, SMDSAbs_Volume );
+    // pySMESH: the layer cells of a face are faces; a volume group holds none of them
+    SMDS_MeshGroup* group = _hyp->CreateGroup( _hyp->GetGroupName(), theMesh,
+                                               isMainShape2D ? SMDSAbs_Face : SMDSAbs_Volume );
 
     for ( SMDS_ElemIteratorPtr it = initMDS->elementsIterator(); it->more(); )
